{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03992","headline":"晦日重宴 · 弓嗣初","name":"晦日重宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年华蔼芳隰，春溜满新池。\n促赏依三友，延欢寄一巵。\n鸟声随管变，花影逐风移。\n行乐方无极，淹留惜晚曦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"弓嗣初","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}